    "notes": [
      "Licensing is state/territory administered; Austroads coordinates recognition lists.",
      "Recognised countries: typically exchange without training/testing for full licence holders (age and local rules apply).",
      "Experienced Driver Recognition tier may still require a knowledge test — modelled as theory_test_required true.",
      "New Zealand has separate trans-Tasman arrangements.",
      "US/Canada: country-level on national lists; states/provinces may still differ locally."
    ]
